# Build artifacts produced by `icuewidget package`
*.icuewidget

# Upstream clone of Corsair's widget builder, tracked in its own repository
/icue-widget-builder/

# Vendored copy of Corsair's iCUE widget documentation. Kept locally as the
# source of truth while building, but not redistributed from this repository.
# The repo's own automations are re-included by name: a negation cannot reach
# a file inside an ignored DIRECTORY, so the directory's CONTENTS are ignored
# instead. The two auditor agents moved to the mit-setup plugin.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/hooks/
!/.claude/skills/
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/deploy-widget/

# Local scratch
node_modules/
*.log
probe*.html
test-*.html

# Audit snapshot - regenerate with /audit-docs, git holds no history of it
DOC-AUDIT.md
